0..75 Comment "// The phase distinction (Sterling and Harper, _Logical relations as types:"
76..151 Comment "// proof-relevant parametricity for program modules_, doi:10.1145/3474834):"
152..225 Comment "// a module\'s type members are its static part and its values its dynamic"
226..298 Comment "// part, ordered static below dynamic. A member reads only members at or"
299..373 Comment "// below its own phase, so a type reads types and static data, and a value"
374..447 Comment "// reads both. A type member reading a module\'s or a parameter\'s value is"
448..520 Comment "// refused by name at the value (`PhaseDependence`), stated beside it in"
521..565 Comment "// `../../pathological/modules/phase.gandr`."
